## Write a Python program to print numbers from 1 to 100 in 10 rows, alternating between odd and even numbers in each row.

Expected output:
1 3 5 7 9
10 12 14 16 18 20
21 23 25 27 29
30 32 34 36 38 40
41 43 45 47 49
50 52 54 56 58 60
61 63 65 67 69
70 72 74 76 78 80
81 83 85 87 89
90 92 94 96 98 100

=======================================================================================================================

for i in range(1, 101, 10):

    if (i // 10) % 2 == 0:
        for j in range(i, i + 10):
            if j % 2 != 0:
                print(j, end=" ")
    else:
        for j in range(i - 1, i + 10):
            if j % 2 == 0:
                print(j, end=" ")

    print()
